  "semantics": [
    "Read-only original-receipt image eligibility; no machine start, worker, terminal reservation, agent probe or PTY.",
    "Stopped images remain eligible. Bare, empty image, branchable and held records reject without dispatch.",
    "Managed terminal source pins the original owner and epoch; later open independently validates current state.",
    "Separately negotiated terminal_preflight:1 requires terminals:1; old approved descriptors retain their existing open path.",
    "Wire and engine enforce a 30-second observation ceiling; no persistent codec shape change."
  ],
